id: JUDGE4-6
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: reject_four_scenes
target: crates/core/src/judge.rs
find: CommandVerdict::MissingArg => self.reject(RejectCategory::MissingArg),
replace: CommandVerdict::MissingArg => self.reject(RejectCategory::NotInThisStep),
expect-fail: four_scenes_are_classified_100_percent
expect-fail: missing_and_shape_go_through_judge_input
expect-fail: rejection_text_prefers_step_on_reject
note: 判定結果の統合で引数不足を別の分類に写す（結線の誤り）
